-- =============================================================================
-- Seed 25 seasonally balanced golf + concert packages - May 2026 correction
--
-- Source: live Ticketmaster-backed search results gathered 2026-05-02.
-- This corrects the strict warm-market pass by allowing East, Midwest, and
